title: mine_foreman
---
<<if verdict("encounter.cleared", "elemental_mine.mother_lode") == "satisfied">>
    Inez: The dial hasn't moved since you came back up. That's the longest quiet we've had all month.
    Inez: Leave your marks on my survey. I'll walk the boundary with the next shift before we cut any more stone.
<<else>>
    Inez: The surface shift is open. The deep shift stays on the clock up here until I know what those knocks mean.
    Inez: The old works share a wall with a natural cavern. We used to get one knock when we started a cut. Lately we get three before we touch the rock.
<<endif>>
-> Is there a way down?
    Inez: Take the cage to the middle landing. Follow the air duct to the relief switch. That opens the screen beside the deep sump.
    Inez: The survey stairs are bolted on the lower side. Open them when you come up and we'll have a second way out.
-> What about the elementals?
    Inez: We used to stop work and let them settle. We were paid by the hour then.
-> Let me through the yard.
===

title: mine_hand
---
Ellis: I'm Ellis. I keep the short carts on the rails and the long carts out of the ditch.
-> What happened to the deep crew?
    Ellis: They came back up. Two of them left their lamps down there. I was going to fetch them, but Inez told me to stay off the lower cage.
-> Is the ore shuttle safe to ride?
    Ellis: The shuttle runs above the basin. Stand on the flat rim and jump off at either dock. If you fall short, the old silt banks will get you back up.
-> See you around.
===

title: mine_geologist
---
Farah: That tray is a section through the west face. I put the samples in order before the wind picked up.
-> What woke up down there?
    Farah: Mother Lode has been here since before the first shaft was sunk. I suspect the crusher set the crystals ringing. I've asked Inez to let me try a smaller hammer on the surface samples first.
-> What are the blue streaks?
    Farah: The miners use three blue seams as survey marks. On the far wall you can hear all three ring if you put your ear near the middle one.
-> I'll leave the samples alone.
===

title: mine_sampler
---
Tamsin: Pick a ticket with a number. Pick a sample with the same number. If they disagree, come get me before you put anything in the oven.
-> Can I reach the basin from here?
    Tamsin: The gallery drains to the upper dock. The basin's west door goes round to the vents. That way you can get back to the intake without waiting for the cage.
-> What do you do between samples?
    Tamsin: I mend work gloves. Inez pays for the leather and Ellis brings the ones with the fingers still in them.
-> Good luck with the batch.
===

title: mine_mother_lode
---
Mother Lode: You struck the shell. The part of me that hears is farther in.
Mother Lode: Tell the people with the wheels they can keep what has fallen. Leave the living seam below the three blue marks.
-> Was that you hitting the wall?
    Mother Lode: The first knock was mine. The other two came back through the rock.
-> I'll tell Inez what I heard.
    Mother Lode: Tell her there is room for quiet work. I can tell the difference.
===
